WEBVTT

00:02:29.708 --> 00:02:31.518
It has great prices.

00:02:31.542 --> 00:02:34.268
But it's also static and impersonal.

00:02:34.292 --> 00:02:37.976
You sit alone in front
of a computer or a mobile phone

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:42.601
scrolling through hundreds of choices
identified by an algorithm,

00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:44.559
delivered by a machine.

00:02:44.583 --> 00:02:46.601
When you do have a query,

00:02:46.625 --> 00:02:49.768
you interact with another
machine or a bot --

00:02:49.792 --> 00:02:52.000
rarely an actual human being.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:55.143
What puzzles me about this

00:02:55.167 --> 00:02:58.351
is when you speak
to a successful salesperson,

00:02:58.375 --> 00:03:00.101
they will always tell you